---
---

<section id="demo" class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-center text-balance reveal">
      Same campaign. Read both.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-center text-muted mt-4 text-lg reveal">These came from the same prompt.</p>

    <div class="mt-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Recipient A -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 reveal-left">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted mb-1">Recipient</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold">John</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted mb-2">Interests</p>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="text-sm border border-gray-200 rounded-full px-3 py-1">AI</span>
            <span class="text-sm border border-gray-200 rounded-full px-3 py-1">Startups</span>
            <span class="text-sm border border-gray-200 rounded-full px-3 py-1">YC</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted mb-3">Generated email</p>
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg p-5 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed border border-gray-100">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink mb-2">John —</p>
            <p>Quick one. We built a tool that rewrites your campaign for each person on your list. Figured it'd click for you since you're deep in the AI/startup world and probably tired of sending the same Mailchimp blast to everyone.</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Open to a quick look?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Recipient B -->
      <div class="border-2 border-primary bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 reveal-right">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted mb-1">Recipient</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold">Sarah</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted mb-2">Interests</p>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="text-sm border border-primary/40 rounded-full px-3 py-1">Fitness</span>
            <span class="text-sm border border-primary/40 rounded-full px-3 py-1">Nutrition</span>
            <span class="text-sm border border-primary/40 rounded-full px-3 py-1">Wellness</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted mb-3">Generated email</p>
          <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg p-5 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed border border-gray-100">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink mb-2">Hey Sarah,</p>
            <p>You know how most marketing emails from wellness brands feel super generic? We made something that fixes that. ulak takes your one campaign and rewrites it for each subscriber, so someone into marathon training gets a totally different email than someone focused on meal prep.</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Two-minute demo if you're curious.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
